re detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-15T19:35:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T19:35:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160133260,"discussion_id":"5f266e0b9a8fc9559857d1e21be7b269344a844d","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-15T19:35:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T19:35:38+08:00","user":{"id":"6704f6ecbaec536c76204d48","login":"urbub","object_id":"6704f6ecbaec536c76204d48","name":"linhailong3","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bd/cc/201b00d0424c20c6a24396bad0e1d03020df125da620e1dad48a6e86806bf9f5.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/urbub"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160133362,"discussion_id":"4de23de302fc9f84aa71640ef8e2d3dacf60850f","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要优化了MoE（Mixture of Experts）分布式计算内核中的状态同步与标志管理机制。首先，重构了RDMA（远程直接内存访问）标志位同步逻辑，通过引入统一的缓冲区大小常量并替换硬编码的数据拷贝方式，提升了代码的可维护性和健壮性，解决了潜在的维护困难与一致性风险。其次，修改了Token分发状态标志的生成逻辑，通过引入动态偏移量解决了多轮次或并发执行场景下可能出现的标志值冲突问题，确保了状态隔离与内核执行的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案包含两部分核心内容。一是引入常量 `FLAG_BUFF_SIZE` 统一管理RDMA标志缓冲区大小，并将多处硬编码的 `DataCopy` 操作替换为更安全的 `DataCopyPad` 函数，传递统一的参数，从而规范了标志位的读写操作。二是在内核中用于判断Token发送与接收的标志值（`SHOULD_SEND_FLAG_VALUE`）基础上，增加一个从共享内存动态获取并递增的每轮唯一值 `magicVal_` 作为偏移，确保不同执行轮次或上下文的状态标志互不干扰，避免了数据处理错误或死锁。","created_at":"2026-01-15T19:36:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T19:36:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160133391,"discussion_id":"ee45c27330c073ac560